    {
      "id": "mx_basic",
      "title": "矩阵作用于向量：Ax = (2, 1)",
      "input": {
        "matrix": [[1, 1], [0, 1]],
        "vector": [1, 1]
      },
      "expected": {
        "ax": [2, 1],
        "columns": [[1, 0], [1, 1]],
        "det": 1,
        "trace": 2,
        "rank": 2,
        "eigenvalues": { "real": true, "values": [1, 1] },
        "invertible": true,
        "inverse": [[1, -1], [0, 1]],
        "singular_reason": null,
        "steps": [
          {
            "step": 1,
            "title": "取输入坐标当倍数",
            "terms": [
              { "coefficient": 1, "column_index": 0, "column": [1, 0] },
              { "coefficient": 1, "column_index": 1, "column": [1, 1] }
            ]
          },
          { "step": 2, "title": "组合各列", "partial": [1, 0], "result": [2, 1] }
        ]
      },
      "notes": "§2.2.3 黄金表 mx_basic。steps[1].partial 定义为第一项（column_index=0）执行后的部分和，即 coefficient[0]*column[0] = [1,0]；否则与 result 重复而无信息量（该语义文档未显式定义，见 contracts/README.md 契约矛盾 C-11）。inverse 按 [[a22,-a12],[-a21,a11]]/det 求得。"
    },
    {
      "id": "mx_identity",
      "title": "单位矩阵：Ax = x",
      "input": {
        "matrix": [[1, 0], [0, 1]],
        "vector": [2, -1]
      },
      "expected": {
        "ax": [2, -1],
        "rank": 2,
        "det": 1,
        "trace": 2,
        "invertible": true,
        "eigenvalues": { "real": true, "values": [1, 1] }
      },
      "notes": "R6-AC11：单位矩阵按公式自然得出 Ax=x（不特判）；det=1、trace=2、特征值双 1 为确定值。"
    },
    {
      "id": "mx_zero_vector",
      "title": "零向量：Ax = (0, 0)，方向未定义",
